	(text "Gain/switching: SPK_GAIN = GVDD_REG x 100k/250k = 2.8 V at GVDD 7.0 V -> 20 dBV, 8 x fSYNC = 768 kHz @48 kHz (Table 15,\n  window 2.33-3.10 V holds for GVDD 5.83-7.75 V). D22: software ceiling -4.0 dBFS keeps 10 W into 4 Ohm.\nLC: type 2 (L per leg, C to GND) as Fig. 79 and SLAA701B 1.3.2 for BD modulation; 10 uH + 0.68 uF: f0 61 kHz,\n  Q 0.52 at 4 Ohm (-0.8 dB at 20 kHz). Power budget cited SLAA701B 1.3.4.1 = type 1 (differential C) - corrected.\nCaps: TI Table 22 values; 0402 parts moved to 0603 (hand assembly D42). PVDD caps > 1.45 x PVDD, LC caps > 1.8 x PVDD.\nOverlay rpi-digiampplus: pcm5122@4c on i2c1, i2s_clk_producer, mute-gpios GPIO22 active high (driver sets 1 = unmute).\nThermal pad: via array + paste windows 70-80 % of the pad area (SLAS988B 11.1.3.2) - footprint in block 2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
